            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=UTF-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\" class=\"sticky-header-html\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"Cookiebot\" src=\"https://consent.cookiebot.com/uc.js\" data-cbid=\"ec6463a5-adc8-4770-a33a-2161a238e881\" data-blockingmode=\"auto\" async=\"async\"></script>\n<noscript><style>form.antibot * :not(.antibot-message) { display: none !important; }</style>\n</noscript><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Stuart Hall is one of the most influential and esteemed cultural theorists of a generation. A thinker and commentator, his peers include other giants of political commentary such as Noam Chomsky, Susan Sontag, Alan Ginsberg, Michel Foucault and Gore Vidal. The Stuart Hall Project takes the viewer on a roller coaster ride through the upheavals, struggles and turning points that made the 20th century the century of campaigning, and of global political and cultural change. Cert 12 Price Free Event\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://haringey.gov.uk/events/film-screening-stuart-hall-project-2013\" />\n<meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Drupal 10 (LocalGov Drupal | https://localgovdrupal.org)\" />\n<meta name=\"MobileOptimized\" content=\"width\" />\n<meta name=\"HandheldFriendly\" content=\"true\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/core/misc/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/vnd.microsoft.icon\" />\n\n    <title>Film Screening: The Stuart Hall Project (2013) | Haringey Council</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" media=\"all\" href=\"/sites/default/files/css/css_QbxQTUASRzFAZ90oxUQn18MrpPQ1yeBJ-MurqMZAFOc.css?delta=0&amp;language=en&amp;theme=lgd&amp;include=eJxtkFFyhCAQRC8EciRrgBaJI1gz6GZvH60ybtbNV0_3648GKtL6FBdx9HsZ-sz6UOuU4Wvbacu7ulO7ocpsLuxexVAFLsq6EHf0Rd9mqKXRA1pnuD9394A_rJqRfegHIHoKk3tzvecaJsOggdFcQoEQX_7UbliZNQhQPlCCtlXQj1Qi55IMp-iwoTQbqUFfXq2251UR6FKL5g22keezqCAJ4zmqBuJUt96TwnkBxSDr7P