            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\" class=\"sticky-header-html\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"Cookiebot\" src=\"https://consent.cookiebot.com/uc.js\" data-cbid=\"ec6463a5-adc8-4770-a33a-2161a238e881\" data-blockingmode=\"auto\" async=\"async\"></script>\n<noscript><style>form.antibot * :not(.antibot-message) { display: none !important; }</style>\n</noscript><meta name=\"description\" content=\"A chronicle of Nelson Mandela&#039;s life journey from his childhood in a rural village through to his inauguration as the first democratically elected president of South Africa. Cert. 12A Price Free Event Contact libraries@haringey.gov.uk Date 7 October 2026 Additional date and time information 2pm (141min)\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://haringey.gov.uk/events/film-screening-mandela-long-walk-to-freedom-2013\" />\n<meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Drupal 10 (LocalGov Drupal | https://localgovdrupal.org)\" />\n<meta name=\"MobileOptimized\" content=\"width\" />\n<meta name=\"HandheldFriendly\" content=\"true\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/core/misc/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/vnd.microsoft.icon\" />\n\n    <title>Film Screening: Mandela: Long Walk to Freedom (2013) | Haringey Council</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" media=\"all\" href=\"/sites/default/files/css/css_QbxQTUASRzFAZ90oxUQn18MrpPQ1yeBJ-MurqMZAFOc.css?delta=0&amp;language=en&amp;theme=lgd&amp;include=eJxtkFFyhCAQRC8EciRrgBaJI1gz6GZvH60ybtbNV0_3648GKtL6FBdx9HsZ-sz6UOuU4Wvbacu7ulO7ocpsLuxexVAFLsq6EHf0Rd9mqKXRA1pnuD9394A_rJqRfegHIHoKk3tzvecaJsOggdFcQoEQX_7UbliZNQhQPlCCtlXQj1Qi55IMp-iwoTQbqUFfXq2251UR6FKL5g22keezqCAJ4zmqBuJUt96TwnkBxSDr7PVGjp-yEKlyJ4mrP17zFp7Db-mMstqZcrnlC6V9YG4M-98qbTlMTzvu2yBGn9owu4P8AKTdxx0\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" media=\"all\" href=\"https://use.fontawesome.com/releases/v5.13.0/css/