          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=UTF-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\" class=\"sticky-header-html\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"Cookiebot\" src=\"https://consent.cookiebot.com/uc.js\" data-cbid=\"ec6463a5-adc8-4770-a33a-2161a238e881\" data-blockingmode=\"auto\" async=\"async\"></script>\n<noscript><style>form.antibot * :not(.antibot-message) { display: none !important; }</style>\n</noscript><meta name=\"description\" content=\"The Creative Art Space is a welcoming, recovery-focused community space bringing people together through creativity, connection and shared ideas. It provides an opportunity for people to explore their talents, try new things, share skills and develop creative ideas in a supportive and inclusive environment. The space aims to bring people and ideas together across Haringey, creating opportunities for people with lived experience, local residents and the wider recovery community to connect, collaborate and celebrate creativity. Over 18&#039;s only.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://haringey.gov.uk/events/creative-arts-space\" />\n<meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Drupal 10 (LocalGov Drupal | https://localgovdrupal.org)\" />\n<meta name=\"MobileOptimized\" content=\"width\" />\n<meta name=\"HandheldFriendly\" content=\"true\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/core/misc/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/vnd.microsoft.icon\" />\n\n    <title>Creative Arts Space | Haringey Council</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" media=\"all\" href=\"/sites/default/files/css/css_rqTIsa0z9d6ZoOv0l167vPYS3IiXkJHPYijhnn6Kwjc.css?delta=0&amp;language=en&amp;theme=lgd&amp;include=eJxtkNGWgyAMRH8I5ZM8AUZkDeBJ0G7_frXHbbd2X5jM3DxMoCJtiGERS7-Toc9s8LXOCa62nba0qz21H6tk88T2teirwAZZF-KevujbjLU0ukFrhv0z9ze4w6qZ2PlhBIIjP9s3NziufjYMGhnNRhQI8dOf2o8rs3oBygeK0LYKholK4FSi4RgsNpTWBWrQl9dO2_25ItClFk0bukaOz0UFiZ_OUtUTx7oNjhTW